Jupiter 2011 Chess (Mg2Upjjo2yg) sprites, m2 2026-11-26. All from the video's own thumbnail
(research/ref/fin2-jupiter/thumbs/maxresdefault.jpg, i.ytimg.com/vi/Mg2Upjjo2yg/maxresdefault.jpg, 1280x720):
- key.png: the red "F" Key cut out of the thumbnail (x120-370, y262-612): border flood fill of the tan board, largest
  component kept, holes filled; 512 px transparent, centred at ~90%. Same art as the in-game Keys (maxres1/maxres2).
- speed.png / queso.png / creek.png (Hark t3b-jupiter, 2026-11-26): video-style greyscale busts, made by
  tools/art_jupiter_busts.py. In the video the astronauts are greyscale head-and-shoulders photos in white spacesuits with
  a dark collar ring (research/ref/fin2-jupiter/thumbs/maxres1.jpg, maxres2.jpg). Faces: the thumbnail portraits cut with
  rembg (u2net_human_seg) + traced outlines (no straight frame cuts), sized by eye distance so all three match; Creek's jaw
  (hidden by Queso's collar in the thumbnail) is inpainted from his own pixels, his hair past the frame edge is a short
  mirror of the hair inside it. Suit: padded collar ring with rivets and shoulders, drawn at 4x and downsampled (no frame
  shows a clean suit). 512 px transparent. Replaces the earlier head-only cutouts (in git history).
Old own-drawn SVGs (speed/creek/queso/key/pod_l/m/r.svg) removed; they are in git history.
